[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m First, I need to model this situation. Let's break it down.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m First, when she walks at speed s km/h, the total time is 4 hours. But this includes t minutes in the coffee shop. So, the actual walking time would be 4 hours minus t minutes, but t is part of the total time, so I need to convert everything into consistent units.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m Let me write down the given information:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=320149)[0m - Distance walked: 9 km
